# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored; never commit a real key.
#
# Google Maps Platform key, used on the server only (address suggestions and route distance).
# Enable "Places API (New)" and "Routes API" for the key's project.
# Restrict the key to those two APIs. It is never sent to the browser.
# Leave empty to run without it: fixed E14 airport fares still work, other routes ask the customer to call.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Anthropic API key for "Just ask me" (plain-English requests filled into the quote form).
# Server only. Leave empty to hide that tab; the normal form keeps working.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
